OL,4,CWelsh Greens back plan to separate     
OL,5,Cfrom English party                     
OL,6,GMembers of the Green Party in Wales    
OL,7,Ghave backed plans to split from their  
OL,8,Gcolleagues in England and form their   
OL,9,Gown independent party.                 
OL,11,FThe Welsh Green conference in Bangor   
OL,12,Fon Sunday supported a motion setting   
OL,13,Fout a timetable to split by 2035,      
OL,14,Fsubject to a further vote of party     
OL,15,Fmembers.                               
OL,17,FBBC Wales was told the changes were    
OL,18,Fendorsed by a large majority of        
OL,19,Fmembers who attended.                  
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
